pected output' line. Differences from the original: the successful forbidden check prints ' - satisfied' where the original printed nothing, the recursive check prints its 'Found on line 4, column 1 ' (identical to the line the first check already printed, so it adds no new text), and reportStyle 'message' is used because the original printed each verdict sentence on its own line with neither a '#####' separator nor a 'Testing ...' line; the only remaining differences are the two described above plus ' - satisfied'.",
